      "title": "1. Introduction",
      "level": 2,
      "line_start": 3,
      "text_length": 725,
      "text_preview": "The `Svc::CmdSplitter` splits an uplinked command execution to two separate `Svc::CmdDispatcher` components: one \"local\" and the other \"remote\". This splitting is done by opcode where local commands a"
