      "number": "3.2",
      "title": "3.2 Functional Description",
      "level": 3,
      "line_start": 36,
      "text_length": 251,
      "text_preview": "The `Svc::CmdSplitter` routes an incoming command buffer of type `Fw::ComBuffer` to a local or remote command dispatcher.  This is done by comparing the command's opcode to the configured base opcode "
    },
    {
      "number": "3.1",
      "title": "3.1 State",
      "level": 3,
      "line_start": 40,
      "text_length": 188,
      "text_preview": "`Svc::CmdSplitter` has only one internal state variable: `m_remoteBase` the configured base opcode for remote opcodes. This is set by a call to the `configure()` method at system start-up."
    },
    {
      "number": "3.2",
      "title": "3.2 Algorithms",
      "level": 3,
      "line_start": 44,
      "text_length": 49,
      "text_preview": "`Svc::CmdSplitter` has no significant algorithms."
    },
